
# CLUB TKO Gym Website

## Project Description
CLUB TKO Gym is a website designed to provide visitors with information about the gym, its fitness classes, membership options and contact details.

The website allows users to explore gym services and submit enquiries.

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Google Maps Embed

## Website Pages
1. Home - Introduction and frequently asked questions.
2. About Us - Information about CLUB TKO Gym.
3. Classes - Information about fitness classes and a class search feature.
4. Membership - Membership information.
5. Enquiry - Membership and service enquiry form.
6. Contact - Contact form and gym location map.

## Interactive Features
- FAQ accordion.
- Enquiry form validation.
- Contact form validation.
- Image lightbox gallery.
- Fitness class search.
- Embedded interactive Google Map.

## Installation and Usage
1. Download or extract the project folder.
2. Open the project folder in Visual Studio Code.
3. Open index.html in a web browser.
4. Navigate through the website using the navigation menu.

## Location
82 Juta Street, Braamfontein, Johannesburg, South Africa.

